{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is in range and visible then move, take, and check it. Finally perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskCompleted    />\"",
